#: ../../library/struct.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`struct` --- pack and unpack primitive data types"
msgstr ""
":mod:`struct` --- pakiranje i raspakiravanje primitivnih tipova podataka"

#: ../../library/struct.rst:7
msgid ""
"This module performs conversions between Python values and C-style structs "
"represented as Python bytes objects, using format strings to describe the "
"layout of the data."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj modul obavlja pretvorbe između Python vrijednosti i struktura u stilu "
"jezika C predstavljenih kao Python bytes objekti, koristeći formatne nizove "
"za opis rasporeda podataka."

